f2nd-recomp patches/0004, regenerated by Re:Fine on ps3recomp v0.18.0 (4e8f3ca).
v0.18.0 (#577, dc37f00b) replaced the lwmutex's binary semaphore (lwm_sem) with a
state word and a wake semaphore behind lwm_slot/lwm_release/lwm_acquire. The
lwcond wait now releases and retakes the lwmutex through those, and keeps
upstream's ppu_thread_note_block before blocking. Same semantics as before.

